--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce1d3326426d8413f86dce414ff780b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: ChiefInspector_LabCall_P2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speaker: Chief Inspector Marcus
    text: Uh kid the results have came in.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: What does it say there chief?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Chief Inspector Marcus
    text: "It in fact has the blood of Julian and \u2026"
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: Yes?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Chief Inspector Marcus
    text: "There\u2019s 2 fingerprint marks found on it. Marco and Vivian."
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: "Vivian? But she has no business in the kitchen or even touching the knife,
      she told me she can\u2019t cook."
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Chief Inspector Marcus
    text: "Exactly, one of them must take part in the killing, but if you\u2019re
      very sure that it wasn\u2019t Marco, then it only puts Vivian in the equation..
      No other fingerprint were found."
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: This mission is successful, we caught the real culprit.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Chief Inspector Marcus
    text: "I\u2019d say don\u2019t straightaway jump to conclusion.. Try confronting
      her first see what she has to say.. Perhaps it is Marco who did this. But you
      know better kid. Good luck."
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: Thanks for that chief.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
